      <h3 id="by-circumference" class="mt-12 text-xl font-semibold">Round the finger: inner circumference in millimetres</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-[62ch] text-text-muted">
        The flat length of a paper strip that went round the finger. This is also how Europe sizes
        rings — under ISO&nbsp;8653 the size <em>is</em> this number — so the row for
        {' '}{eu54.eu}&nbsp;mm is the row for an EU or French {eu54.eu}.
      </p>

      <div class="table-scroll mt-5">
